### Testar cadastro de bicicleta

### 5. Fazer Login do ciclista (Armazena o token automaticamente)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}

### 6. Consultar ciclista por ID (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 7. Consultar ciclista por nome (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/buscarNome/Roberto
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. Listar ciclista (rota privada)
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. apagar ciclista (rota privada)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}


### 9. Testar cadastro do atualizar
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "codCliente": "1",
    "nome": "Santiago",
    "email": "santiago@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "endereco": "rua abc, 5",
    "telefone": "47912345678"
}